cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
distribution-package.1	1							python/pyproject.toml declares the build system and the project by the Values
distribution-package.2	1							javascript/package.json declares the package by the Values
distribution-package.3	1							server.json names and describes the server and lists its npm and PyPI packages
distribution-package.4	1							each README says what void-os is, how it is installed, and lays out the modules by their secrets
distribution-package.5	1							each LICENSE is the MIT License's text with the Value copyright holders
